{
  "info": {
    "name": "Seruwit Tenant Staff Mobile API v1",
    "description": "REST API komprehensif untuk aplikasi mobile internal tenant (Owner, Branch Manager, Checker Lapangan, dan Driver Karyawan).\n\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1` di domain tenant masing-masing (misal: `https://andito.seruwit-crm.test` atau domain kustom).\n\n**Autentikasi:** Bearer Token via Laravel Sanctum (`{{token}}`).\n\n**Modul yang Tersedia:**\n1. **Auth & Profil Staf:** Login berbasis email/username, profil pengguna, dan logout.\n2. **Executive Dashboard:** KPI armada aktif, sewa berjalan, omzet bulanan, dan badge pending review.\n3. **Approval Center:** Konfirmasi bukti bayar rekening & review perpanjangan sewa (rental extension).\n4. **Field Checker & AI Inspection:** Jadwal handover, eksekusi checkout/checkin, kalkulasi denda/excess km otomatis, dan Gemini Vision AI photo analysis.\n5. **Driver Operational & Cash Claims:** Surat Perintah Kerja (SPPD), update perjalanan real-time, dan klaim pengeluaran kas operasional (BBM, tol, parkir).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "centralUrl",
      "value": "https://seruwit.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://andito.seruwit.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "centralToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tenantId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "rentalId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "extensionRequestId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "dutyOrderId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "expenseId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Central Auth (Pintu Masuk seruwit.com)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Central Login & List Workspaces",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data) {",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.central_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('centralToken', jsonData.data.central_token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.api_base_url) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', jsonData.data.api_base_url.replace('/api/staff/v1', ''));",
                  "    } else if (jsonData.data.tenants && jsonData.data.tenants.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('tenantId', jsonData.data.tenants[0].id);",
                  "        if (jsonData.data.tenants[0].domain) {",
                  "            pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', 'https://' + jsonData.data.tenants[0].domain);",
                  "        }",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"owner@seruwit.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"device_name\": \"Mobile App\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{centralUrl}}/api/central/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Login satu pintu di domain central (seruwit.com). Mengembalikan daftar seluruh perusahaan/workspace yang terhubung ke user ini."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pilih Workspace & Dapatkan Token Tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data) {",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.api_base_url) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', jsonData.data.api_base_url.replace('/api/staff/v1', ''));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{centralToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device_name\": \"Samsung S24 Ultra\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{centralUrl}}/api/central/v1/workspaces/{{tenantId}}/token",
            "description": "Menukar token central untuk mendapatkan token Sanctum spesifik pada schema tenant yang dipilih."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Tenant Direct Auth & Profil Staf",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Staf / Driver",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved:', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"manager@seruwit.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"device_name\": \"Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra (Checker)\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Login menggunakan email atau username staf/sopir tenant. Token Sanctum otomatis disimpan ke variabel {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil Akun Login (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/auth/me",
            "description": "Mendapatkan profil staf yang sedang login, daftar peran (roles), izin akses, serta profil driver jika terikat."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout Staf",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/auth/logout",
            "description": "Mencabut (revoke) token Sanctum yang sedang aktif pada perangkat ini."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Executive Dashboard (Owner & Manager)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Ringkasan Dashboard (KPI Summary)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/dashboard/summary",
            "description": "Menampilkan ringkasan armada aktif, pemeliharaan/bengkel, rental berjalan, pendapatan kotor bulan ini, serta jumlah item yang membutuhkan persetujuan."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Approval Center (Finance & Ops)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftar Bukti Transfer Pending",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/approvals/payments",
            "description": "Mengambil daftar pembayaran transfer bank manual pelanggan yang menunggu konfirmasi admin/keuangan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Konfirmasi Bukti Transfer (Approve Payment)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"notes\": \"Dana sudah masuk ke rekening BCA operasional, valid.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/approvals/payments/{{rentalId}}/confirm",
            "description": "Menyetujui bukti transfer, menandai deposit/pembayaran lunas, dan mengubah status rental menjadi 'confirmed'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tolak Bukti Transfer (Reject Payment)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rejection_reason\": \"Nominal transfer tidak sesuai dengan tagihan booking.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/approvals/payments/{{rentalId}}/reject",
            "description": "Menolak bukti transfer dan mengirimkan alasan penolakan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Daftar Permintaan Perpanjangan Sewa",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/approvals/extensions",
            "description": "Daftar pengajuan perpanjangan hari sewa dari pelanggan yang belum diputuskan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review Perpanjangan Sewa (Approve / Reject)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"approved\",\n  \"rejection_reason\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/approvals/extensions/{{extensionRequestId}}/review",
            "description": "Menyetujui atau menolak perpanjangan sewa. Jika disetujui, tanggal selesai sewa otomatis diupdate dan tagihan baru diterbitkan."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Field Checker & Inspeksi AI (Ops Lapangan)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Jadwal Serah Terima Hari Ini",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/handovers/today?type=all",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "staff",
                "v1",
                "handovers",
                "today"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "all",
                  "description": "all | pickup | return"
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "2026-10-24",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar serah terima armada hari ini (jadwal keberangkatan sewa dan pengembalian unit)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eksekusi Handover Out (Serah Terima ke Customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"start_odometer\": 15200,\n  \"start_fuel_level\": \"Full\",\n  \"checkout_notes\": \"Unit mulus, toolkit dan ban cadangan lengkap.\",\n  \"checkout_checklist\": {\n    \"stnk_present\": true,\n    \"spare_tire_present\": true,\n    \"jack_present\": true,\n    \"ac_cold\": true\n  },\n  \"customer_signature\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\",\n  \"staff_signature\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/handovers/{{rentalId}}/out",
            "description": "Menyelesaikan serah-terima unit keluar. Status sewa otomatis beralih menjadi 'active'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Inspeksi AI Kerusakan Bodi (Gemini Vision)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"photos\": [\n    \"https://storage.seruwit.test/photos/return_front.jpg\",\n    \"https://storage.seruwit.test/photos/return_side.jpg\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/handovers/{{rentalId}}/ai-inspect",
            "description": "Menjalankan inspeksi Gemini Vision AI untuk membandingkan foto serah terima dengan foto kepulangan, ekstraksi odometer & level BBM, serta deteksi goresan baru."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eksekusi Handover In (Pengembalian Unit)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"end_odometer\": 15550,\n  \"end_fuel_level\": \"3/4\",\n  \"actual_return_date\": \"2026-10-24\",\n  \"return_notes\": \"Unit kembali tepat waktu, bodi dalam kondisi baik.\",\n  \"return_checklist\": {\n    \"stnk_present\": true,\n    \"spare_tire_present\": true\n  },\n  \"damages\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Baret halus bemper belakang\",\n      \"amount\": 150000\n    }\n  ],\n  \"customer_signature\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/handovers/{{rentalId}}/in",
            "description": "Memproses kepulangan mobil, menghitung selisih odometer (excess km), denda keterlambatan (overdue), dan rekonsiliasi deposit."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Driver Duties & Cash Claims (Sopir Karyawan)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Daftar Surat Jalan Driver (Duties)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/driver/duties?status=active",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "staff",
                "v1",
                "driver",
                "duties"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "active",
                  "description": "all | active | on_duty | completed"
                },
                {
                  "key": "date",
                  "value": "2026-10-24",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Menampilkan penugasan sopir yang sedang login atau daftar tugas seluruh sopir (jika admin/manager)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail Surat Jalan & Pengeluaran Kas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/driver/duties/{{dutyOrderId}}",
            "description": "Melihat detail surat tugas, penumpang, armada, uang muka jalan (cash advance), dan daftar bukti pengeluaran yang dicatat sopir."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status Tugas (Berangkat / Selesai)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"on_duty\",\n  \"notes\": \"Driver telah menjemput penumpang di bandara.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/driver/duties/{{dutyOrderId}}/status",
            "description": "Memperbarui status perjalanan sopir: 'on_duty' (berangkat) atau 'completed' (selesai tugas)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Klaim Uang Jalan (BBM, Tol, Parkir)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"category\": \"fuel\",\n  \"amount\": 250000,\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-24\",\n  \"receipt_number\": \"SPBU-541234\",\n  \"description\": \"Isi Pertamax 20L di Rest Area KM 57\",\n  \"receipt_photo\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/driver/duties/{{dutyOrderId}}/expenses",
            "description": "Mencatat pengeluaran kas operasional sopir (kategori: fuel, toll, parking, meal, lodging, repair, other). Otomatis menghitung sisa saldo uang jalan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus Bukti Pengeluaran",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/driver/duties/{{dutyOrderId}}/expenses/{{expenseId}}",
            "description": "Menghapus item pengeluaran yang keliru diinput sopir sebelum surat jalan diselesaikan (settled) oleh tim keuangan."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Reservasi Offline & Kasir Lapangan (Field Operator & Desk Staff)",
      "description": "Endpoint khusus operator/staf lapangan untuk menangani pemesanan walk-in secara offline: cek armada, scan OCR identitas, hitung tarif, create booking, dan terima kas/EDC di tempat.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Cek Ketersediaan Kendaraan",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/rental/reservations/available-vehicles?start_date=2026-10-26&end_date=2026-10-28&period_type=daily",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "staff",
                "v1",
                "rental",
                "reservations",
                "available-vehicles"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "start_date",
                  "value": "2026-10-26"
                },
                {
                  "key": "end_date",
                  "value": "2026-10-28"
                },
                {
                  "key": "period_type",
                  "value": "daily"
                },
                {
                  "key": "rental_class",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "transmission",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Melihat daftar kendaraan aktif yang tersedia pada rentang waktu tertentu beserta saran harga sewa per periode."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Scan Identitas KTP / SIM dengan AI OCR",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"image\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,...\",\n  \"doc_type\": \"ktp\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/staff/v1/rental/customers/scan-id",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "staff",
                "v1",
                "rental",
                "customers",
                "scan-id"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Scan foto fisik KTP / SIM pelanggan menggunakan Gemini Vision AI OCR untuk mengekstrak NIK, Nama, dan data identitas secara instan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Pendaftaran / Cari Pelanggan Walk-In",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.success && jsonData.data && jsonData.data.partner_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', jsonData.data.partner_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
